{{!
	One template for all eight engagement events: the event-specific sentence
	arrives as the "summary" instruction, because handlebars here has no
	text-file lookup and the copy belongs next to the rest of the plugin's in
	text/Sharing/content. Fields are the message's instructions, so every
	string below is one Sharing_Notice put there. Selected by
	instructions.templateName, which Streams_Message.deliver prefers over the
	message type (ro#769).
}}
<p>{{summary}}</p>
<p><strong>{{listingTitle}}</strong></p>
{{#if note}}<p>{{note}}</p>{{/if}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{cta}}</a></p>
<p style="color:#888;font-size:12px">{{why}}</p>
